-- GAME ----------------------------------------------------------------------
  Title       Pyjamarama
  Publisher   Mikro-Gen, 1984
  Version     1.1

-- YOU NEED ------------------------------------------------------------------
  Your own copy of the original game, saved beside this patch:

  File        Pyjamarama (1984)(Mikro-Gen).z80
  MD5         1ff279754d0730e503816199ac6976f3

  The patch carries none of the game's code. It only works with that exact
  dump, under that name or any other: anything else is refused, with a
  message naming the file it wants.

-- WHAT IT DOES --------------------------------------------------------------
  Moving figures become Next hardware sprites, so they keep their own colours
  and no longer take on the scenery's (colour clash). Game logic is unchanged.

  Colours     Default (the game's own) plus: Enhanced, chosen on the menu, off
              by default.
  Enhanced    Pink skin, blue pyjamas and red slippers; multi-colour
              collectables, birds, tools, food and other figures. Solid black
              drawn detail, no outlines. Flat palette and editable native PNG
              sheets. Scenery retains the game colours. Source: Enhanced
              colours: Jon Attree.

  Pace        original

  Changes     v1.1 owner art revision 1: flat orange coins from the owner PNG.
              All 200 graphics may use hardware sprites below the HUD,
              including collectables. 28 MHz hooks restore incoming CPU speed
              and R. Full Sinclair hidden ROM image; loading screen and
              verified trainers.

  Note        O/P left/right; M jump/use. Any key past title, ENTER to play.
              Enhanced is off by default. Original pace target; remaining
              measured overhead below 2%. Hardware untested.

-- MENU ----------------------------------------------------------------------
   1  Infinite lives
   2  Infinite energy
   3  Immunity

